        "description": "Twihweje intangamarara ijanye n'icete ca kabiri c'ab' I Tesalonike. Twarumvise ko ico cete caje nk'inyishu y'ibibazo vyinshi vyari mu mitima y'abakristo b'I Tesalonike. Twarihweje kandi imirongo itatu (3) itangura igice ca 1 c'ico cete. Twarumvise mundamukanyo ya Paulo ingene yipfurije ubuntu n'amahoro abakristo bose bari mu Mana no mu mwami Yesu Kristo. Twarangije twumva ingene yarafise ishimwe mu mutima kubona abakristo bashishikara gukura mu kwizera no mu kugira urukundo hagati yabo.",
